5,1,1,talk,George,,"Since we're here to fix this, I think we should be thorough. I'd like to look into what two other car-sharing households said and the spell of checking each other's figures.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll take the hours of use recorded in the diary and the weeks of heavy use over the year.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I'll look into the state of the car at handover and the trips that repeat weekly.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll check last year's tax, insurance and parking papers, as well as last year's fuel receipts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Minato,,I want to know about the mechanic's remarks at the last service and a month's trial of recording every run.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,George,,"Does anyone have any objections to these choices, or do you think we've missed something important?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Victoria,,These seem like a comprehensive set of data points to start with. I don't see any reason to change them.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. It covers the financial side, the usage patterns, and the social friction. Let's proceed.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Minato,,I'm excited to see what we find out! I think it's a good idea to look at everything.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,George,,"Since we are all in agreement, I suggest we move forward and gather the information. Does that work for everyone?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,It works for me. Let's get to it.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I agree. Let's see what the data actually tells us before we try to make any decisions.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I'm ready. Let's see if the numbers match our impressions.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Minato,,Me too! I'll go look for my things right now.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,George,,I'll make sure we all have the materials we need. Let's take our time with the research and reconvene once we've each reviewed our chosen points.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll start reviewing the diary and the heavy use periods now. See you all shortly.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I'll go through the handover notes and the weekly trip patterns. I'll see you all soon.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll get started on the paperwork and the fuel receipts. I'll let you know what I find.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Minato,,I'll go check the mechanic's notes and the trial records! See you all in a bit!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
